  "prefLabel": "He-W 854.11 Federally Mandated Excluded Income",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 854.11 Federally Mandated Excluded Income. All income that is considered excluded pursuant to a federal mandate shall be excluded for medical assistance.\n\nSource. #13715, eff 8-8-23",
